<!--
  A watch face you can play with: the Fit3 panel in its own 256x402 proportion,
  tilted off-axis, wearing clock hands over a row of palette dots, with a sparkle
  caught on its top corner.

  It is deliberately not a diagram of the editor. The hands say "watch face", the
  three dots say "yours to recolour", and the tilt and the sparkle are the whole
  point — the previous mark was an accurate schematic of the canvas and read as
  two stacked boxes.

  The colours are the product's tokens, not a separate icon palette — primary
  #7FE3D2 for the panel and hands, the canvas #0A0E0E behind them, and secondary
  #F2C879, error #FFAF9F and tertiary #C8B6FF for the three dots, all from
  core:ui FitFaceTheme.

  Everything stays inside the 66dp adaptive-icon safe circle: the panel reaches
  28.9 of the 33 available from centre, the sparkle's top point 32.1.
-->
